[{"key":"SCENARIO_s03_04040000_00_0001","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s03_04040000_00_0010","text":"目标是恶魔太郎的闪卡……！\n说“一二”就打开哦……！"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s03_04040000_00_0020","text":"嗯！／嗯……！"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s03_04040000_00_0030","text":"哦……！"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s03_04040000_00_0040","text":"要开了哦……！\n一二────"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s03_04040000_00_0005","text":"出了张\n闪闪发光的"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s03_04040000_00_0006","text":"这样如何……？"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s03_04040000_00_0007","text":"普通卡……"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s03_04040000_01_0001","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s03_04040000_01_0010","text":"诶……！\n制作人……！好厉害……！！"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s03_04040000_01_0020","text":"是甜花想要的那张吗……？\n那这张就是甜花的了"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s03_04040000_02_0001","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s03_04040000_02_0010","text":"啊，制作人的，和甘奈一样！\n是普通卡呢～"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s03_04040000_02_0020","text":"呵呵\n这个恶魔太郎贴纸，也好可爱……！"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s03_04040000_03_0001","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s03_04040000_03_0010","text":"啊呜……\n而且……甜花，已经有这张了……"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s03_04040000_03_0020","text":"那张……\n送给制作人……！"}]
